<title>FINLAND: OLVI JAN-AUG PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>OLVI JAN-AUG PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p>Profit before extraordinary items,</p>
<p> appropriations, taxes		    20.4 vs 32.1</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    7.11 vs 11.77</p>
